{"step_index":3533,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T18:43:10Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T21:43:10+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T21:43:10+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/walkthrough.md`\nTotal Lines: 67\nTotal Bytes: 4499\nShowing lines 1 to 60\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Walkthrough: Parallel Processing, Resilient Extraction, Gemini Fallback & Production Deployment\n2: \n3: All requested enhancements, bug fixes, parallel performance optimizations, and production packaging have been implemented and verified end-to-end.\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## 1. Parallel Multi-Threaded File Extraction (المعالجة المتوازية للملفات)\n8: - **Problem**: Previously, files were uploaded and processed sequentially one-by-one. When processing multiple warehouse catalogs (e.g. 6 PDFs), the total time accumulated to over 30 minutes, and any single network timeout aborted all remaining files.\n9: - **Solution (`src/extract/file_handler.py`)**:\n10:   - Implemented `ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=min(len(filepaths), 8))`.\n11:   - All warehouse files (PDF, Excel, JSON) are now dispatched concurrently in parallel threads.\n12:   - The Unstructured API accepts concurrent requests, allowing all cloud extraction jobs to run simultaneously.\n13:   - Finished files are returned, saved, and cached independently as soon as they complete.\n14: \n15: ---\n16: \n17: ## 2. 22-Page Hadaba PDF Resolution (`الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf`)\n18: - **Problem**: \n19:   - The 22-page Hadaba PDF document timed out on synchronous HTTP requests (> 16 minutes), and when it completed, Unstructured returned 0 items because the data was formatted as an HTML `<table>` in `markdown` rather than `extracted_data`.\n20: - **Solution (`src/extract/pdf_reader.py`)**:\n21:   - Extended polling timeout to 24 minutes (180 attempts × 8s) with \n<truncated 1025 bytes>\nuctured API raises an exception or returns 0 items, `_extract_with_gemini_fallback` is triggered automatically.\n36:     - Successfully extracted all 19 items from `جملة العمروووو.pdf` in seconds.\n37:     - Saves the result directly to local cache (`.unstructured_cache/` and alongside `.json`), ensuring subsequent runs load instantly.\n38: \n39: ---\n40: \n41: ## 4. UI Modal & Queue System Fixes\n42: - **Modal Left-Alignment**:\n43:   - `#progress-modal` is constrained inside `<main class=\"main-content\">` with absolute positioning, keeping the right sidebar interactive and accessible during long runs.\n44:   - Fixed DOM hierarchy closing tags in `desktop_app/templates/index.html`.\n45: - **Process Queue (`كيو`)**:\n46:   - Queued runs wait safely in FIFO order and start automatically when the active process finishes.\n47: \n48: ---\n49: \n50: ## 5. End-to-End Extraction Verification Across All 6 Warehouses\n51: \n52: | Warehouse PDF File | Pages | Extracted Items | Extraction Method | Status |\n53: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n54: | **السلام شبين.pdf** | 3 pages | 187 items | Unstructured AI | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n55: | **المكرومي المنصورة.pdf** | 10 pages | 503 items | Unstructured AI | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n56: | **الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf** | 22 pages | 1,071 items | Unstructured (Markdown Table) | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n57: | **جملة العمروووو.pdf** | 1 page | 19 items | Unstructured / Gemini 3.6 Fallback | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n58: | **مخزن الحياة فارم اسكندريه-170.pdf** | 4 pages | 222 items | Unstructured AI | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n59: | **كيور فارما خاص.pdf** | 13 pages | 715 items | Unstructured AI | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n60: | **TOTAL** | **53 pages** | **2,717 items** | **Concurrent Threads** | ✅ **100% Extracted** |\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":3534,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T18:43:10Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Update walkthrough with Single Message execution and MSEMAX session diagnosis\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: Parallel Processing, Resilient Extraction, Gemini Fallback & Production Deployment\\n\\nAll requested enhancements, bug fixes, parallel performance optimizations, and production packaging have been implemented and verified end-to-end.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Parallel Multi-Threaded File Extraction (المعالجة المتوازية للملفات)\\n- **Problem**: Previously, files were uploaded and processed sequentially one-by-one. When processing multiple warehouse catalogs (e.g. 6 PDFs), the total time accumulated to over 30 minutes, and any single network timeout aborted all remaining files.\\n- **Solution (`src/extract/file_handler.py`)**:\\n  - Implemented `ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=min(len(filepaths), 8))`.\\n  - All warehouse files (PDF, Excel, JSON) are now dispatched concurrently in parallel threads.\\n  - The Unstructured API accepts concurrent requests, allowing all cloud extraction jobs to run simultaneously.\\n  - Finished files are returned, saved, and cached independently as soon as they complete.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. 22-Page Hadaba PDF Resolution (`الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf`)\\n- **Problem**: \\n  - The 22-page Hadaba PDF document timed out on synchronous HTTP requests (> 16 minutes), and when it completed, Unstructured returned 0 items because the data was formatted as an HTML `<table>` in `markdown` rather than `extracted_data`.\\n- **Solution (`src/extract/pdf_reader.py`)**:\\n  - Extended polling timeout to 24 minutes (180 attempts × 8s) with an initial 20-second fast-wait to prevent hanging synchronous sockets.\\n  - Enhanced `parse_structured_result()`:\\n    1. First inspects schema `extracted_data`.\\n    2. If empty or absent, parses HTML `<table><tr><td>...</td></tr></table>` directly from `result[\\\"markdown\\\"]` with automatic column detection (Arabic column headers like `اسم الصنف`, `اسم الدواء`).\\n  - **Result**: Successfully extracted **1,071 drug items** with full names, strengths, and pack sizes.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Resilience & Automatic Gemini 3.6 Flash \n<truncated 3054 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with single-message execution and MSEMAX diagnosis\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\kakak\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Update walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Document single-message mode and MSEMAX diagnosis\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
